     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">I am commonly working with data that has a value for every day, and I would like to do year-over-year comparisons. What&#39;s the best way to do a self join in order to grab &quot;earlier&quot; data from the same tibble?<div><br></div><div>Here&#39;s an example tibble:<div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">a </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tribble</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">day</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">same_day_last_year</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  ymd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;20170313&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">180</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ymd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;20160314&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  ymd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;20170312&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\